---
shbc
-- at last, bc replacement in pure sh
---
Features
-- floating point math 
---- reimplemented successor to psh-fractional
---- redone to avoid overflows and flawed math
-- sqrt() in pure sh
---- featuring several custom/standard algorithms
-- exponents ...
-- others to come perhaps...
---- plans for at least sin() and cos()
---
Arithmetic operations
-- posix sh already provides arithmetic operators within $(())
---- as such these will likely not be reimplemented
